        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Everything starts with a **vector field**: at each point of phase space, an arrow telling the\nstate where to go next. A flow is what you get by following those arrows. Fixed points are where\nthe arrows vanish — the skeleton around which all trajectories organize. This chapter builds the\nobjects; Chapter 02 makes the stability rigorous."
    },
