        "title": "Flows and Fixed Points",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A fixed point is a *constant solution*: if you start exactly on it, you stay forever. The entire\nqualitative theory is: locate the fixed points, decide their stability, and connect them with the\ntrajectories the arrows demand."
    },
